    {
      "id": "claim_f3922501ac6245edacad918fa9f608b2",
      "statement": "New builds the registry from three catalog sources in order: kido (builtin, live probe with static fallback, no key required, config BaseURL override), the opencode zen catalog (best-effort by contract — a failed cache/live load, parse failure, or missing opencode metadata simply omits the provider and startup never fails because of it; an empty opencode.api falls back to the production Zen base), and config-defined providers (any cfg.Provider id other than kido/opencode with a base URL and at least one model, sorted by id); the default is kido/Qwen3.8-27B overridden by cfg.Model.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/provider/provider.go#L102-L181",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d15137cd93fa171ab60335a13bbed868597c9a497a4feb3c8708f95744d395a:"
