      "id": "claim_e892191cf60044b09b2f3d46141f134f",
      "statement": "The zen catalog is served with a TTL-bounded cache: a fresh cache file wins, otherwise it fetches live (10 s timeout, browser-style User-Agent, 8 MiB cap) and rewrites the cache atomically (temp file + rename), and a failed fetch falls back to the stale cache; ParseZenCatalog keeps only paid models (cost.input > 0), excludes @ai-sdk/google providers, and maps the adapter from provider.npm (@ai-sdk/anthropic -> anthropic, else openai).",
